<title>USA: Tyco completes tender offer for Electrostar.</title>
<headline>Tyco completes tender offer for Electrostar.</headline>
<dateline>EXETER, N.H. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyco International Ltd said Monday it completed the tender offer for all outstanding common shares of ElectroStar Inc at $14 per share.</p>
<p>The offer expired at midnight on January 3.</p>
<p>At the offer's expiration, 7,407,972 shares, or about 98 percent of the outstanding common shares of ElectroStar, were tendered by shareholders, according to ChaseMellon Shareholder Services L.L.C., the depositary.</p>
